/* Cash forecast — vanilla JS single-page app (Business Apps).
 * State: one document in IndexedDB "stratum-cashflow" (store "kv", key "db"), generated by data.js on first load.
 * engine.js turns it into a 13-week forecast for the chosen scenario; nothing is ever sent anywhere.
 * Per-viewer choices (scenario, custom levers, filters) live in localStorage "stratum-cashflow-ui".
 * Other open tabs are told about changes via BroadcastChannel("stratum-cashflow").
 * Routing: #/, #/weeks, #/months, #/receivables, #/payables, #/plan, #/scenarios, #/settings. */
